e with her fairy companion, Alisa.\nShe is runaway high royalty who became a gyaru because she found gyarus very interesting. Very self sufficient despite being royalty, she loves to cook and clean for herself. Alisa is a lazy and introverted NEET mangaka. Always late with her manga.\nFeel free to draw them however you wish. I look forward to your work!\n\nSeo & Alisa: https://photos.app.goo.gl/5nG89M2fYF6M4wmc9", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UnioPrince/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3402998, "client_id": 392528, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd18f4f7/uploads/origins/89f815bd-5c8a-4ea3-88b9-d6f271313eb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bda39142438eb6e9b49d08bfabc6e4ca", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd18f4f7/uploads/origins/89f815bd-5c8a-4ea3-88b9-d6f271313eb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bda39142438eb6e9b49d08bfabc6e4ca, https://si.imgix.net/cd18f4f7/uploads/origins/89f815bd-5c8a-4ea3-88b9-d6f271313eb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff098143f2abad89affce635120c8414 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd18f4f7/uploads/origins/89f815bd-5c8a-4ea3-88b9-d6f271313eb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5057fb74839398cf27095d45f762736d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd18f4f7/uploads/origins/89f815bd-5c8a-4ea3-88b9-d6f271313eb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=93c9df87009707e506808ed26020c675", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd18f4f7/uploads/origins/89f815bd-5c8a-4ea3-88b9-d6f271313eb0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=93c9df87009